 Rogue..... Built from KFM. Programmed with love. ^_^

;2-AirDash Controller
;5-Decides What Upgrade you get
;6-Time Upgrade Lasts
;21-Danger Warning
;25-Controls Armor Mode
;30-Determines whether or not opponent is mechanical
;50-Controls Finishing Effect
;54-Power Steal Variable

[Data]
